<title>USA: Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iowa-Southern Minnesota</p>
<p>direct hogs weekly average weights of barrows and gilts for the</p>
<p>week ending May 3, 1997, according to the USDA.</p>
<p>Iowa-So Minnesota direct hogs    Receipts   Average Weight/lbs</p>
<p>week ending:  5-3-97		  308000	    254.3</p>
<p>week ending:  4-26-97		 288000	    253.3</p>
<p>year ago:     5-4-1996		345000	    248.9</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
